  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After three angry birds fuse into a fire phoenix and crash into the green giant’s arm, leaving a hole that green fog mends, Blazing Heaven Demoness keeps attacking from the air. She points at the giant and slashes her arm from up to down, activating this fire path killer move. Three waves of flame form at once, resembling phoenix feathers, curved and sharp like sickles. They tear through the air, burn intensely, and raise huge winds. The three blades launch one after another and hit the same place consecutively. Together with the angry bird, they form another combo move, and the green giant’s arm is chopped off. The detached arm, cut off from the ancient battle formation’s immortal essence supply, vanishes. Gu worms fly back to the giant, and Hei Cheng falls free.",
